msgid "(Is that...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "(That looks like Kinoshita's wife, Yuko.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san. What brings you here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Yuya, what can you tell me about that woman over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Who? You mean Yuko-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"She's been a regular customer of ours for years. What do you\r\n"
"want with her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "She looks awfully rich for somebody so young."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "She manages a venture-funded startup."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"Her company got popular making products targeted at young\r\n"
"women, and it's been growing pretty fast over the last\r\n"
"four, five years."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Ooh, Yuya, who is that? I haven't seen him here before.\r\n"
"Is he a new host?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Ah, Yuko-san. This is Kiryu-san. We owe a lot to this man\r\n"
"here. And, no, he's not a host."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "Oh, I see. Well, that's unfortunate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"This is my company, by the way. If you ever need anything,\r\n"
"just give me a call."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "You got <Color:8>Yuko's Business Card<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Bye, now. Tonight was fantastic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "We'll be looking forward to seeing you again!"
msgstr ""

